<TA[Zelinka and Hartmann, (2010), Why is longwave cloud feedback positive?]]></title>
		<link>https://blogs.exeter.ac.uk/hugolambert/blog/2011/03/30/zelinka-and-hartmann-2010-why-is-longwave-cloud-feedback-positive/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 30 Mar 2011 16:08:15 +0000</pubDate>
						<dc:creator><![CDATA[fhl202]]></dc:creator>
